    {
      "id": "p0018-b013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This joke, translated literally, means \"I have two legs, so I'm Japanese\". Even though it's an incredibly simple, straightforward joke in Japanese, we can see how it makes zero sense when translated into English.",
